      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. So it's really about those amplitude fractions and inharmonicity. When you mention those \"inharmonic\" sounds that can feel a bit more out of place, does that ever lead to sounds that feel almost like they're \"trickling\" or \"scurrying\" around the main melody? I'm curious if there's a specific way those non-integer overtones are categorized in formal acoustics.",
